From 814ac52aec8d253fc0629ffb82e4a1024177f6a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mrinohk <5554998+Mrinohk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 08:45:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02/31] cuda : fused swiglu prep and token-count policy for
 sm_60 fp16 matvec

The fused swiglu writes the fp16 layout for ffn_down. With one token only the
output layer and ffn_down take the fp16 path, other matvecs slow the rest of
the graph more than they gain. With 2+ tokens all of them take it.
GGML_CUDA_P60_ALL=1 takes every case. The prep cache now has 4 slots.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
